            "review_text": "traveller_001\nSydney, Australia107 contributions\n0\nTerrible!\nJan 2017 • Solo\nWent here thinking it was a smaller version of great dim sum place along that street I went to last year. I was wrong. Service was appalling. Girl \"forgot\" I ordered a drink when ten minutes after ordering I hadn't received. Took another 20 minutes for any food to arrive. There were only two other tables of couples so no excuse for poor service when there appeared to be several staff dressed in uniforms playing with their phones. When food arrived, order was wrong as only receive one crab claw instead of the three I pointed to in photo so I ordered another dish. After waiting a further 20 minutes I asked for bill as I decided I go elsewhere to finish my meal. Even getting bill took 8 minutes and again all the staff were just standing around playing with phones. Food bland. Biting into a prawn dumpling I got a lot of air and water before the small shrimp.\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2017",
